[{"client_msg_id":"cf6b0860-6e0a-4c72-bb15-805620d685b6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ピクセル転送はドローコールなのかどうか怪しいので、なるべく言葉としては使わないようにします","ts":"1632139340.288400","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1632139347.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y+v1j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65d21e9d-20c3-4889-b11f-8d0aa151d6b4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"そうかもしれないですね","ts":"1632139320.287800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"97/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5976a739-a2df-4c20-b16d-e7ab5852107e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"一般用語かは、ちょっと微妙だけど、Unityが強いから流通してる単語みたいな?","ts":"1632135558.287400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UBb+1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a402681-30cd-4a3b-805d-f37c49471630","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"処理をまとめるのは一般的にバッチ処理とはいうのでそれは間違いなさそう","ts":"1632135359.286800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KKII"}]},{"client_msg_id":"800d57e8-bff8-4e32-9a88-464b748d9834","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Unity 用語っぽいんですよねドローコール","ts":"1632135329.286300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9AUoz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6193c5f-f5ab-4817-85c6-379e88826294","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://docs.unity3d.com/ja/2018.4/Manual/DrawCallBatching.html\u003e\n定義は確定的かは不明ですが、Unityで利用しつつ、バッチではあるんですよね(随時もあったはずだけど)","ts":"1632134752.285800","attachments":[{"fallback":"ドローコールバッチング - Unity マニュアル","id":1,"title":"ドローコールバッチング - Unity マニュアル","title_link":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ja/2018.4/Manual/DrawCallBatching.html","text":"オブジェクトをスクリーンに描画するためには、グラフィックス API (OpenGL や Direct3D 等) に対してドローコールが必要です。グラフィックス API はドローコールごとに非常に多くの処理をするため、ドローコールは高負荷で、CPU 側のパフォーマンスオーバーヘッドの原因になります。これは大抵、ドローコール間に状況の変更 (例えばマテリアルの切り替えなど) が発生することに起因し、グラフィックスドライバーで高負荷な検証と 変換処理の原因となります。","thumb_url":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ja/2018.4/uploads/Main/StaticTagInspector.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"docs.unity3d.com","service_icon":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ja/2018.4/StaticFiles/images/favicons/apple-touch-icon-152x152.png","thumb_width":396,"thumb_height":148,"from_url":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ja/2018.4/Manual/DrawCallBatching.html","original_url":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ja/2018.4/Manual/DrawCallBatching.html"}],"edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1632135567.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ByfO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e05bd20b-54b2-4df1-8f96-148fcf57a692","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"定義が曖昧なので「バッチ処理」と呼ぶことにしました","ts":"1632133697.285100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rMAOV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2fd1c37-ee77-4145-b684-93847c5b129e","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`glDrawElements` が 1 ドローコールであるというのはよく見るんですが、 `glTexSubImage2d` は入らないんですかね","ts":"1632132380.284600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OLt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a41b4293-3e72-4d04-a8c9-a65d346da6d8","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"「ドローコール」って俗語であって、あまりちゃんとした定義はひょっとしてない?","ts":"1632132303.283800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Nwny"}]}]
